# Cloud-sync duplicates (this folder lives in iCloud/Dropbox).
# After a sync run, the cloud client copies every new file as
# "bil-474617364 2.html", "images/470180828/1 2.jpg", etc. sync.py --publish
# runs `git add -A`, so without this they get committed and go live as
# orphan car pages. No real file in this repo has a space in its name.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
* [0-9]
*conflicted copy*
* ([0-9]).*
